INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(3692,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7312300','Occupational Medicine and Environmental Health in the Border Areas of Euro-Arctic Barents Region: A Review of 30-Year Russian-Norwegian Research Collaboration Outcomes.','Chashchin VP, Gorbanev S, Thomassen Y, Nieboer E, Ellingsen DG, Syurin S, Nikanov A, Chashchin M, Odland JØ.','2020','nwphrc uit arctic tromsø nioh unn tromsø chashchin nwphrc kirovks murmansk metallurgical adjoining kola nwphrc uit arctic tromsø nioh unn tromsø metallurgical adjoining kola sør varanger murmansk arctic subarctic tromsø kirkenes tor norseth stami valery chashchin kola kirovsk sudbury tromsø nikel zapolyarny apatity kirovsk umba kola particulates arctic metallurgical murmansk sulphur upheaval nwphrc eiliv valeri chashchin perestrojka emitted uit nioh sør varanger nikel apatity umba kola polluted tromsø refinery kola kola nikel zapolyarniy monchegorsk murmansk refinery monchegorsk kola sulfidic oxidic refinery monchegorsk refinery particulates inhalable kola nioh monchegorsk monchegorsk monchegorsk kola metallurgical monchegorsk apatity kola shipyard welding shipyard welders nioh welders welding ultrafine welding stami uit underground mineworkers apatite oulu umea barents barents mineworkers climates nikel zapolyarny murmansk nikel zapolyarny puerperas pechenga murmansk mushrooms berries pechenga pechenga unn tromsø nwphrc stami arctic arctic lomonosov arkhangelsk narfu arctic hypothermic welding murmansk underground ultrafine metallurgical murmansk myocardiopathy pneumosclerosis tetracarbonyl metallurgical kola murmansk occupationally kirovsk apatity metallurgical pechenga monchegorsk pechenga monchegorsk ore pechenga gorbanev nwphrc natalya romanova ljudmila talykova morten skandfer arild vaktskjold memoriam kola 133p kola 149p tromso 124p arctic subarctic uit arctic tromsø 160p odland apatiti oao kirovsk tromso 31p oao apatity kirovsk kola tromsø 47p barents guidebook infomethodic desribed kirovsk tr